#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Omatutor: a vimtutor-style game that drills Omarchy/Hyprland keybindings.

It plays inside your real window manager. A small pinned HUD gives you an
instruction, you press the real keys, and the tutor watches Hyprland's state
(over its IPC socket) to see whether you did it. Practice windows are labelled
tiles (A, B, C...) on a spare workspace, and everything is cleaned up on exit.

  omatutor            launch the tutor (spawns its own HUD window)
  omatutor drill      jump straight into the 5-minute drill
  omatutor sprint     jump straight into the 60-second sprint
  omatutor lesson N   jump straight into lesson N
  omatutor --reset    forget all progress and stats
"""

